#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ledgers"
msgstr "Knjige"

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Ledger View"
msgstr "Pregled knjiga"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:17
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Ledger view is where most of the functionality of &kappname; lies. "
#| "This view is for examining and entering transaction data in the various "
#| "accounts. The view is split into three main areas: the filter area, the "
#| "transaction list, and the input area."
msgid ""
"The Ledger view is where most of the functionality of &kmymoney; lies. This "
"view is for examining and entering transaction data in the various accounts. "
"The view is split into three main areas: the filter area, the transaction "
"list, and the input area."
msgstr ""
"U ovom pregledu se nalazi većina funkcionalnosti &kappname;. Ovaj pregled "
"služi za istraživanje i unos transakcija podataka za razčičite račune. "
"Pregled je podijeljen u tri glavna prostora: filter dio, listu transakcija i "
"prostor za unos."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This view allows for several key actions: searching and viewing "
"transactions, entering new transactions, and editing or deleting existing "
"transactions. Other functionality includes modifying account details and "
"reconciling the account."
msgstr ""
"Pregled omogućava nekoliko ključnih akcija: pretragu i pregled transakcija, "
"unos nove transakcije i editovanje ili brisanje postojeće transakcije. "
"Ostale funkcionalnosti uključuju modificiranje detalja računa i izravnavanja "
"računa."

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Ledger View"
msgstr "Pregled knjiga"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "The view has three elements:"
msgstr "Pregled ima tri elementa:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The filter area</para>"
msgstr "<para>Filter prostor</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The transaction list</para>"
msgstr "<para>Lista transakcija</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The transaction input form, which may or may not appear, depending upon your "
"configuration."
msgstr ""
"Forma za unos transakcija, koja se može a i ne mora pojaviti u ovisnosti o "
"vašoj konfiguraciji."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The filter area</title>"
msgstr "<title>Filter prostor</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filter area"
msgstr "Filter prostor"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select an account via the account dropdown list at the top of the "
"view area. Note that depending upon the type of the account the <link "
"linkend=\"details.ledger.transactionform\">transaction input form</link> at "
"the bottom of the view changes."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati račun pomoću opadajuće liste računa na vrhu prostora "
"pregleda. Imajte na umu da u ovisnosti o tipu računa <link linkend=\"details."
"ledger.transactionform\">forma unosa transakcija </link> na dnu pregleda se "
"mijenja."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:82
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To the right of the account dropdown list, are two additional fields. The "
"search box acts as a filter on the transactions that are shown in the list "
"view. Only transactions that include the text typed in the search box are "
"displayed. The text specified can be in any of the fields of the "
"transaction. The status field is a dropdown list. Only transactions of the "
"type selected in that dropdown are displayed."
msgstr ""
"Desno od opadajuće liste računa se nalaze dva dodatna polja. Prostor za "
"pretragu se ponaša kao filter za transakcije koje su prikazane u pregledu "
"listi. Samo transakcije koje sadrže ukucani tekst u prostor za pretragu su "
"prikazane. Tekst specificiran se može nalaziti u bilo kojem polju "
"transakcija. Statusno polje je opadajuća lista. Samo transakcije odabranog "
"tipa u toj opadajućoj listi su prikazane."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The transaction list</title>"
msgstr "<title>Lista transakcija</title>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transaction list"
msgstr "Lista transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:109
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "After you have entered a transaction, it is displayed in the transaction "
#| "list. You can also change transaction properties or even create new "
#| "transactions directly in the list. In the transactions list, the default "
#| "arrangement of transactions is sorted by date with the most recent "
#| "transaction on the bottom. Clicking the Right Mouse Button on the header "
#| "of the transaction list brings up a dialog that allows you to change the "
#| "sort order of the transactions. For instructions on how to change the "
#| "default sort order, see the <link linkend=\"details.settings.register."
#| "sorting\">Sorting tab</link> section of the <link linkend=\"details."
#| "settings\">&kappname; Settings</link> Chapter."
msgid ""
"After you have entered a transaction, it is displayed in the transaction "
"list. You can also change transaction properties or even create new "
"transactions directly in the list. In the transactions list, the default "
"arrangement of transactions is sorted by date with the most recent "
"transaction on the bottom. Clicking the Right Mouse Button on the header of "
"the transaction list brings up a dialog that allows you to change the sort "
"order of the transactions. For instructions on how to change the default "
"sort order, see the <link linkend=\"details.settings.register.sorting"
"\">Sorting tab</link> section of the <link linkend=\"details.settings"
"\">&kmymoney; Settings</link> Chapter."
msgstr ""
"Nakon što ste unijeli transakciju, prikazana je u listi transakcija. Također "
"moćete promijeniti osobine transakcije ili čak kreirati novu transakciju "
"direktno iz liste. U listi transakcija, unaprije definisani raspored "
"transakcija je sortiranje po datumu sa najnovijim transakcijama na dnu. "
"Desnim klikom na naslov liste transakcije pojavljuje se dijalog koji vam "
"omogućava da promijenite pravilo po kojem su sortirane transakcije. Za "
"instrukcije o tome kako promijeniti unaprijed definisano pravilo za "
"sortiranje, pogledajte <link linkend=\"details.settings.register.sorting"
"\">Sorting tab</link> sekciju <link linkend=\"details.settings\">&kappname; "
"postavke</link> poglavlja."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the balance column is based on the currently displayed sort order, "
"and will not be calculated if the display is filtered by the search box or "
"transaction type dropdown, as described above."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da je kolona bilansa bazirana na trenutno prikazanom "
"redoslijedu sortiranja i neće se računati ukoliko se prikaz filtrira pomoću "
"prostora za pretragu ili tipa transakcije kao što je iznad opisano."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:127
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "At the bottom of the transaction list, &kappname; displays three values:"
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the transaction list, &kmymoney; displays three values:"
msgstr "Na dnu liste transakcija, &kappname; prikazuje tri vrijednosti:"

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "Last reconciled"
msgstr "Zadnje izmireno"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the most recent date on which you reconciled this account. "
"Reconciliation is an important process for many accounts, and is described "
"<link linkend=\"details.reconcile\">here</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je najnoviji datum na koji ste poravnali ovaj račun. Poravnavanje je "
"važan proces za većinu računa i opisan je <link linkend=\"details.reconcile"
"\">ovdje</link>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cleared"
msgstr "Očišćeno"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:140
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is the total of all cleared and reconciled transactions in this "
"account. See <link linkend=\"details.ledgers.cleared\">this section</link> "
"for more information about the cleared and reconciled states of transactions."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ukupna vrijednost svih očišćenih i izravnatih transakcija u ovom "
"računu. Pogledajte <link linkend=\"details.ledgers.cleared\">ovu sekciju</"
"link> za više informacija o očišćenom i poravnatom stanju transakcija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid "Balance"
msgstr "Bilans"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:149
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This is where &kappname; displays the total balance of the account, which "
#| "is the sum of all transactions in the account. However, if you select "
#| "more than one transaction in the transaction list, this changes to "
#| "display the sum of the selected transactions. This returns to the balance "
#| "when only one transaction is selected."
msgid ""
"This is where &kmymoney; displays the total balance of the account, which is "
"the sum of all transactions in the account. However, if you select more than "
"one transaction in the transaction list, this changes to display the sum of "
"the selected transactions. This returns to the balance when only one "
"transaction is selected."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje &kappname; prikazuje ukupni bilans računa, koji je suma svih "
"transakcija u ovom računu. Ipak, ukoliko odaberete više od jedne transakcije "
"u listi transakcija, ovo će se promijeniti u prikaz sume odabranih "
"transakcija. Ovo se vraća na bilans kada je samo jedan račun odabran."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The transaction input form</title>"
msgstr "<title>Forma unosa transakcija</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:162
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The exact layout of the bottom area of the ledger view depends on your "
"configuration and the type of account being displayed. However, it generally "
"includes fields for all the details of a single transaction, as well as "
"buttons for various actions that can apply to a transaction. It is described "
"in more detail in the following sections."
msgstr ""
"Tačan prikaz prostora na dnu pregleda ovisi o vašoj konfiguraciji i o tipu "
"računa koji je prikazan. Ipak, većinom uključuje polja za sve detalje jedne "
"instrukcije kao i dugmad za različite akcije koje se mogu primijeniti na "
"transakciji. Ovo je detaljnije opisano u sljedećim sekcijama."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering Transactions"
msgstr "Unos transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are two methods of entering transactions into the ledger: using the "
"transaction input form and entering the data directly into the transaction "
"list. The transaction input form is displayed by default and this is the "
"method we will discuss first."
msgstr ""
"Postoje dvije metode za unos transakcija u knjigu: upotrebom forme unosa "
"transakcije i unosom podataka direktno u listu transakcija. Forma za unos "
"transakcije je prikazana i ovu ćemo metodu prvo diskutovati."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:182
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The fields in the input area match the information fields in the "
"transactions list. Additional fields include the Memo field, for a more "
"detailed description of the transaction, and a Category selection. The Split "
"button allows you to split the transaction into multiple categories."
msgstr ""
"Polja u prostoru za unos odgovaraju poljima informacija u listi transakcija. "
"Dodatna polja uključuju Memo polje, za detaljniji opis transakcije i odabir "
"Kategorije. Dugme Razdvajanje vam omogućava da razdvojite transakciju u više "
"kategorija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the transaction input form"
msgstr "Upotreba forme za unos transakcija"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:200
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transaction Form"
msgstr "Forma transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:206
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The transaction input form at the bottom of the ledger view is the interface "
"for creating transactions."
msgstr ""
"Forma za unos transakcija na dnu pregleda je interfejs za kreiranje "
"transakcija."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:211
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Depending upon the type or method of transaction you wish to enter there are "
"several tabs available on the transaction form. Click on the tab that best "
"describes your transaction (deposit, transfer, or withdrawal) and the form "
"will load several fields ready for your input."
msgstr ""
"U ovisnosti o tipu ili metodi transakcije koju želite unijeti, postoji više "
"tabova omogućenih na formi transakcije. Kliknite na tab koji najbolje "
"opisuje vašu transakciju(depozit, transfer ili podizanje) i forma će "
"prikazati nekoliko polja spremnih za unos."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:218
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Please note that the actual transaction method is not used directly by "
#| "&kappname; but is purely for grouping/reporting purposes."
msgid ""
"Please note that the actual transaction method is not used directly by "
"&kmymoney; but is purely for grouping/reporting purposes."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da stvarna metoda transakcije nije direktno korištena od "
"strane &kappname; nego se koristi samo u svrhu grupisanja/izvještaja."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:223
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you are unsure which method to choose simply use Deposit for any money "
"going into the account, Withdrawal for money coming out of the account, and "
"Transfer for money moving from one account to another. The transaction "
"methods and the differences between them are discussed in more detail "
"elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko niste sigurni koju metodu odabrati, koristite Depozit za sav novac "
"koji pristiže na vaš račun, Povlačenje za sav novac koji napušta vaš račun i "
"Transfer ukoliko se novac prebacuje sa jednog računa na drugi.Metode "
"transakcija i razlika između njih su detaljnije opisane negdje drugo."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:231
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select the transaction method by clicking on one of the tabs."
msgstr "Odaberite metodu transakcije klikom na jedan od tabova."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:236
#, no-c-format
msgid "The fields of a transaction"
msgstr "Polja transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:238
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Enter the information using the following notes on the available fields. "
#| "Note that many fields have 'Auto Completion' turned on. That is, if you "
#| "start typing, &kappname; will offer alternatives matching the characters "
#| "you have entered so far. To select an entry click on it using the mouse "
#| "or keyboard, or if your entry is not listed keep typing to add the new "
#| "value. The next time you type the value in, &kappname; will find it for "
#| "you after the first few characters have been input."
msgid ""
"Enter the information using the following notes on the available fields. "
"Note that many fields have 'Auto Completion' turned on. That is, if you "
"start typing, &kmymoney; will offer alternatives matching the characters you "
"have entered so far. To select an entry click on it using the mouse or "
"keyboard, or if your entry is not listed keep typing to add the new value. "
"The next time you type the value in, &kmymoney; will find it for you after "
"the first few characters have been input."
msgstr ""
"Unesite informacije upotrebom sljedećih zabilješki o omogućenim poljima. "
"Imajte na umu da mnoga polja imaju 'Auto Dopunjavanje' uključeno.Ukoliko "
"počnete pisati, &kappname; će vam ponuditi alternative koje odgovaraju "
"znakovima koje ste dosad unijeli.Da biste odabrali unos kliknite na njega "
"mišem ili tastaturom ili ukoliko vaš unos nije u toj listi nastaite kucati "
"da biste dodali novu vrijednost. Sljedeći put kada budete počeli kucati, "
"&kappname; će je pronaći nakon nekoliko unesenih znakova."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:249
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Payee"
msgstr "Primalac/davalac"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:251
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Payee is who the money came from/to. If the payee is a new entry "
#| "&kappname; will ask if you wish to add this to the list of Payees. Any "
#| "other information related to a payee or payer, such as address details "
#| "can be updated in the Payees view later."
msgid ""
"The Payee is who the money came from/to. If the payee is a new entry "
"&kmymoney; will ask if you wish to add this to the list of Payees. Any other "
"information related to a payee or payer, such as address details can be "
"updated in the Payees view later."
msgstr ""
"Payee(primalac/davalac) je osoba povezana sa novcem. Ukoliko je payee novi "
"unos, &kappname; će vas pitati da li želite da ga dodate u Payee listu. Sve "
"ostale informacije vezane za Payee, kao što su detalji o adresi se mogu "
"ažurirati u Payee pregledu kasnije."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Category"
msgstr "Kategorija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:262
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The Category associates a transaction with an income or expense category "
#| "for accounting and reporting purposes, and enables you to group certain "
#| "transactions. Type the name of the category into the required field. If "
#| "you have entered the category and it does not exist then &kappname; will "
#| "ask if you want to create a new one."
msgid ""
"The Category associates a transaction with an income or expense category for "
"accounting and reporting purposes, and enables you to group certain "
"transactions. Type the name of the category into the required field. If you "
"have entered the category and it does not exist then &kmymoney; will ask if "
"you want to create a new one."
msgstr ""
"Kategorija povezuje transakciju sa prihod ili rashod kategorijom u svrhu "
"računovodstva i izvještavanja i omogućava vam da grupišete određene "
"transakcije. Unesite ime kategorije u odgovarajuće polje. Ukoliko ste "
"unijeli kategoriju koja ne ostoji, &kappname; će vas pitati da li želite da "
"kreirate novu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:270
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you wish to associate parts of the transaction with different "
#| "categories, &kappname; can let you do that. An example transaction might "
#| "be a cash machine withdrawal of 50 of which you use 10 on food, 20 on "
#| "beer and 20 as spare cash. The transaction will therefore be assigned "
#| "three categories: Food, Beer, and Cash. To do this, you need to use <link "
#| "linkend=\"details.ledgers.split\">Split Transactions</link>, which is "
#| "described in more detail below."
msgid ""
"If you wish to associate parts of the transaction with different categories, "
"&kmymoney; can let you do that. An example transaction might be a cash "
"machine withdrawal of 50 of which you use 10 on food, 20 on beer and 20 as "
"spare cash. The transaction will therefore be assigned three categories: "
"Food, Beer, and Cash. To do this, you need to use <link linkend=\"details."
"ledgers.split\">Split Transactions</link>, which is described in more detail "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko želite da povežete dijelove transakcije sa različitim transakcijama, "
"&kappname; će vam to omogućiti. Primjer transakcije moeže biti dizanje 50 "
"konvertibilnih maraka sa bankomata od kojih vam 10 treba za hranu, 20 za "
"pivu i 20 kao dodatni novac. Transakcija će tada biti podijeljena u tri "
"kategorije: Hrana, Piva i Novac. Da bisteovo uradili, morate koristiti <link "
"linkend=\"details.ledgers.split\">Podijeli transakcije</link>. što je "
"opisano detaljnije ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:280
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "See the special <link linkend=\"reference.widgets\">&kappname; fields</"
#| "link> section for more information on how to use this field."
msgid ""
"See the special <link linkend=\"reference.widgets\">&kmymoney; fields</link> "
"section for more information on how to use this field."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte posebna <link linkend=\"reference.widgets\">&kappname; polja</"
"link> sekciju za više informacija o tome kako koristiti ovo polje."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Tag"
msgstr "Oznaka"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:289
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Tags were introduced to &kappname; in version 4.7, and they are not yet "
#| "fully documented in this handbook. Tags are similar to Categories, and "
#| "can be used to maintain an orthogonal view to Categories. For example, "
#| "you might have a Category for each different type of automotice expenses, "
#| "and then have a Tag for each vehicle. As with Categories, you can select "
#| "from the dropdown list, or type a new Tag name, and be prompted if you "
#| "want to create a new Tag with that name."
msgid ""
"Tags were introduced to &kmymoney; in version 4.7, and they are not yet "
"fully documented in this handbook. Tags are similar to Categories, and can "
"be used to maintain an orthogonal view to Categories. For example, you might "
"have a Category for each different type of automotice expenses, and then "
"have a Tag for each vehicle. As with Categories, you can select from the "
"dropdown list, or type a new Tag name, and be prompted if you want to create "
"a new Tag with that name."
msgstr ""
"Oznake su uvedene u &kappname; u verziji 4.7, i još nisu uvijek u potpunosti "
"dokumentovani u ovom priručniku. Oznake su slične kategorijama i mogu se "
"koristiti za ortogonalni pregled Kategorija. Npr., možete imati Kategoriju "
"za svaki različit tip automobilskog troška i onda imati Oznaku za svako "
"vozilo. Kao i sa Kategorijama, možete odabrati ime iz opadajuće liste ili "
"ukucati novo ime Oznake i bićete upitani da li želite kreirati novu oznaku "
"sa tim imenom."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Memo"
msgstr "Memo"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:302
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A multi-line memo can be entered if you wish to help you remember what the "
"transaction was for."
msgstr ""
"Višelinijski memo može biti unesen ukoliko želite da pomognete sebi da "
"zapamtite za šta služi transakcija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Check Number"
msgstr "Broj čeka"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:311
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The check number can be entered if needed. Note that the check number can "
"always be visible if desired. This is configured in the Settings dialog."
msgstr ""
"Broj čeka može biti unesen ukoliko je potrebno. Imajte na umu da broj čeka "
"uvijek može biti vidljiv ukoliko to želite. Ovo se postavlja u dijalogu "
"Postavke."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:318
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Date"
msgstr "Datum"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:320
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The transaction's posting date must be entered to specify when the "
#| "transaction took place. See the special <link linkend=\"reference.widgets"
#| "\">&kappname; fields</link> section for more information on how the date "
#| "input field can be used to make entering dates quicker and easier."
msgid ""
"The transaction's posting date must be entered to specify when the "
"transaction took place. See the special <link linkend=\"reference.widgets"
"\">&kmymoney; fields</link> section for more information on how the date "
"input field can be used to make entering dates quicker and easier."
msgstr ""
"Datum uknjižena transakcije mora biti unesen kako bi se odredilo kada je "
"došlo da transakcije. Pogledajte posebna <link linkend=\"reference.widgets"
"\">&kappname; polja</link> sekciju za više informacija o tome kako se taj "
"unos može koristiti da bi se unos datuma ubrzao i olakšao."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Amount"
msgstr "Iznos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:331
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Finally, enter the transaction amount into the required field. Note that a "
"simple calculator can be displayed, either by clicking the icon to the right "
"of the amount field, or by entering the % character into the field, or by "
"entering a formula, as in <emphasis>12 + 3</emphasis>. When entering the "
"plus sign, the calculator will be opened."
msgstr ""
"Na kraju, unesite iznod transakcije u odgovarajuće polje. Imajte na umu da "
"će se jednostavan digitron pojaviti, ili klikom na ikonu desno od polja za "
"iznos, ili unosom % znaka u polje, ili unosom formule, kao <emphasis>12 + 3</"
"emphasis>. Kada unesete znak plus, digitron će se pojaviti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:339
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied that all the fields have been filled in correctly, "
"click on <guibutton>Enter</guibutton>. If you accidentally press or click on "
"<guibutton>Enter</guibutton> before you have finished entering all the data, "
"click on <guibutton>Edit</guibutton> to resume entering the data."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste zadovoljni sa svim popunjenim poljima, kliknite na "
"<guibutton>Unesi</guibutton>. Ukoliko slučajno pritisnete <guibutton>Unesi</"
"guibutton> prije nego ste unijeli sve podatke, kliknite <guibutton>Izmijeni</"
"guibutton> da biste nastavili sa unosom podataka."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:350
#, no-c-format
msgid "Directly inputting transactions into the list"
msgstr "Direktan unos transakcija u listu"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:359
#, no-c-format
msgid "Direct Transaction Entry"
msgstr "Direktni unos transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:365
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The second method of entering transactions into the ledger involves editing "
"the transaction list itself directly."
msgstr ""
"Druga metoda za unos transakcija u knjigu uključuje editovanje liste "
"transakcija direktno."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:370
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "To do this you must first let &kappname; know that you don't want to use "
#| "the transaction form by opening the settings dialog and unchecking the "
#| "<guilabel>Show transaction form</guilabel> option."
msgid ""
"To do this you must first let &kmymoney; know that you don't want to use the "
"transaction form by opening the settings dialog and unchecking the "
"<guilabel>Show transaction form</guilabel> option."
msgstr ""
"Da biste uradili ovo morate prvo dopustiti &kapname; da sazna da ne želite "
"koristiti formu za transakciju otvaranjem dijaloga postavki i otčekivanjem "
"<guilabel>Show transaction form</guilabel> opcije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:376
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "This is performed by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
#| "<guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
#| "menu bar and selecting the "
#| "<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
#| "\"ledgers_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> Register</"
#| "guiicon> icon from the list on the left. The option to uncheck is labeled "
#| "<guilabel>Show transaction form</guilabel>. When finished click on "
#| "<guibutton>OK</guibutton> to be ready to directly enter transactions."
msgid ""
"This is performed by selecting <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &kmymoney;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the menu "
"bar and selecting the <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"ledgers_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> Register</"
"guiicon> icon from the list on the left. The option to uncheck is labeled "
"<guilabel>Show transaction form</guilabel>. When finished click on "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> to be ready to directly enter transactions."
msgstr ""
"Ovo se radi odabirom <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Konfiguriši &kappname;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz meni bara "
"i odabirom <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"ledgers_view.png\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> Registruj</guiicon> "
"ikone sa liste lijevo. Opcija za otčekivanje je označena sa "
"<guilabel>Prikaži transakcijsku formu</guilabel>. Kada završite kliknite na "
"<guibutton>U redu</guibutton> da biste bili spremni da direktno unesete "
"transakcije."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:387
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starting the edit"
msgstr "Pokretanje uređivanja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:389
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter a new transaction into the register you can now either click on an "
"empty entry, press <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Ins</keycap></"
"keycombo>, or click <guibutton>New</guibutton> at the foot of the window. "
"The <keycap>Up</keycap> and <keycap>Down</keycap> arrow keys let you "
"navigate through the list. After pressing &Enter; or double clicking on an "
"entry, the transaction list displays the fields required to enter the "
"transaction and waits for input."
msgstr ""
"Da biste unijeli novu transakciju u registar možete ili kliknuti na prazan "
"unos, pritisnuti <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Ins</keycap></"
"keycombo>, ili kliknuti na <guibutton>New</guibutton> na dnu prozora. Tipke "
"strelica <keycap>Up</keycap> i <keycap>Down</keycap> vam omogućavaju da "
"navigirate kroz listu. Nakon pritiska &Enter; ili duplog klika na unos, "
"lista transakcija prikazuje polja potrebna za unos transakcije i za čekanje "
"za unos."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:399
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To move through the fields press the &Tab; key and when done press &Enter; "
"to save the changes or &Esc; to cancel."
msgstr ""
"Da biste se kretali kroz polja pritisnite &Tab; tipku i kada završite "
"pritisnite &Enter; da biste sačuvali promjene ili &Esc; da ne biste."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In case the option <guilabel>Use Enter to move between fields</guilabel> is "
"selected, the &Enter; moves to the next field just as the <keycap>TAB</"
"keycap> key except for the last entry field where it stores the data."
msgstr ""
"U slučaju da je <guilabel>Koristite Enter za prelazak između polja</"
"guilabel> opcija odabrana, &Enter; će vas prebaciti na sljedeće polje kao i "
"<keycap>TAB</keycap> tipka osim zadnjeg polja unosa kada se podaci spašavaju."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:412
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which method you use to enter transactions is up to you and is a matter of "
"personal preference."
msgstr ""
"Koju metodu želite da koristite za unos transakcija ovisi ovama i vašem "
"ličnom preferiranju."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:420
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split Transactions"
msgstr "Podijeljene transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Split transaction feature allows you to divide up a transaction into "
"multiple categories, representing, for example, the different items bought "
"with a single purchase at a store."
msgstr ""
"Opcija podijeljenih transakcija vam omogućava da podijelite transakcije u "
"više kategorija, koje predstavljaju npr. različite stavke kupljene u jednoj "
"kupovini u prodavnici."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:428
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To enter a split transaction, using either the transaction input form or the "
"transaction list, start a new transaction as normal, including entering the "
"total amount. Then, instead of selecting a category, click the "
"<guibutton>Split</guibutton> button. If you have already selected a "
"category, that becomes the first entry in the split editor screen."
msgstr ""
"Da biste unijeli podijeljenu transakciju, upotrebom ili forme unosa "
"transakcije ili liste transakcije, pokrenite novu transakciju kao i inače, "
"uključujući unos ukopnog iznosa. Potom, umjesto odabira kategorije, kliknite "
"na <guibutton>Split</guibutton> dugme. Ukoliko ste već odabrali kategoriju, "
"to postaje prvi unos u podijeljenom editoru."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:436
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the split editor screen, double-click an empty line to enter a new sub-"
"transaction or press <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Ins</keycap></"
"keycombo>. Specify the category, add an (optional) memo, and enter the "
"amount. To save this part of the split, press the green check mark under the "
"category. To cancel, press the red cross."
msgstr ""
"U podijeljenom editoru, dupli klik na praznu liniju da unesete novu "
"podtransakciju ili pritisnite <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Ins</"
"keycap></keycombo>. Specificirajte kategoriju, dodajte(opcionalno) memo i "
"unesite iznos. Da sačuvajte ovaj dio podjele, pritisnite zeleni znak ispod "
"kategorije. Da poništite, pritisnite crveni križ."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:444
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After entering a split, the bottom of the split editor shows how much of the "
"total transaction is still unassigned. After entering all the splits, press "
"the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button to save the entire transaction. If "
"there is still an unassigned amount, you will be prompted to either return "
"to editing the splits, change the total transaction amount, or leave part of "
"the transaction unassigned."
msgstr ""
"Nakon unosa podjele, dno podijeljenog editora prikazuje koliko ste od ukupne "
"transakcije ostavili nedodijeljeno. Nakon unosa svih podjela, pritisnite "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> dugme da sačuvate cjelokupnu transakciju. Ukoliko "
"idalje imate nedodijenog iznosa, bićete upitani ili da se vratite na "
"editovanje podjela, promijenite ukupni iznos transakcija ili ostavite dio "
"transakcije nedodijeljen."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Note that the category field in the transaction input form or the "
"transaction list now displays <emphasis>Split transaction</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da polje kategorije u formi unosa transakcije ili liste "
"transakcije sada prikazuje <emphasis>Split transaction</emphasis>."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-ledgers.docbook:460
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split transactions"
msgstr "Podijeljene transakcije"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:466
#, no-c-format
msgid "Split transaction"
msgstr "Podijeljena transakcija"

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:475
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing transactions"
msgstr "Editovanje transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit a transaction, select it in the list view and either click on "
"<guibutton>Edit</guibutton> in the transaction input form or right click on "
"the entry and select <guimenuitem>Edit</guimenuitem> from the popup menu. If "
"you are editing transactions directly in the list you can edit the "
"transaction simply by double clicking on an entry or by pressing &Enter; "
"when a transaction is highlighted."
msgstr ""
"Da biste editovali transakciju, odaberite je u pregledu liste i ili kliknite "
"na <guibutton>Edit</guibutton> u formi unosa transakcije ili desnim klikom "
"na unos i odabirom <guimenuitem>Edit</guimenuitem> iz popup menija. Ukoliko "
"editujete transakcije direktno u listi, možete editovati transakcije "
"jednostavno duplim klikom na unos ili pritiskom &Enter; kada je transakcija "
"označena."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:487
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting transactions"
msgstr "Brisanje transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:489
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a transaction, select it in the list view, right click on the "
"entry, and select <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> from the popup menu when "
"it appears, or click <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> on the transaction form."
msgstr ""
"Da biste obrisali transakciju, odaberite je u pregledu liste, desnim klikom "
"na unos i odaberite <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> iz popup menija kada "
"se pojavi ili kliknite na <guibutton>Delete</guibutton> u formi transakcije."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:497
#, no-c-format
msgid "Matching Transactions"
msgstr "Povezivanje transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:499
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "Generally, when importing transactions, either via QIF, OFX, or HBCI, "
#| "&kappname; will automatically attempt to match them against existing "
#| "transactions. To allow for differences in the dates, there is a default "
#| "setting of 4 days, which may be changed in the settings - Register/"
#| "Import. Any transactions so matched will be highlighted in green. On "
#| "completion of the import, you should review these and either accept or "
#| "unmatch them."
msgid ""
"Generally, when importing transactions, either via QIF, OFX, or HBCI, "
"&kmymoney; will automatically attempt to match them against existing "
"transactions. To allow for differences in the dates, there is a default "
"setting of 4 days, which may be changed in the settings - Register/Import. "
"Any transactions so matched will be highlighted in green. On completion of "
"the import, you should review these and either accept or unmatch them."
msgstr ""
"Uopšteno kada unosite transakcije, ili putem QIF, OFX ili HBCI, &kappname; "
"će automatski pokušati da ih poveže sa postojećim transakcijama. Da biste "
"omogućili razlike u datumima, postoji unaprijed definisana postavka od 4 "
"dana, koja se može promijeniti u postavkama - Register/Import. Sve "
"transakcije tako povezane će biti označene zelenom bojom. Po završetku "
"unosa, trebali biste pregledati ove i ili ih prihvatiti ili ih odspojiti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:508
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you should find that an imported transaction was not automatically "
"matched with an existing transaction when it should have matched, then it is "
"possible to match them manually. Note that there is a difference between "
"manually matching two transactions and simply deleting one of them, even "
"though they may appear to have the same effect. Specifically with OFX or "
"HBCI, it is important not to delete the imported transaction, because you "
"will find that the next time you import your transactions, the deleted "
"transaction shows up again. This is because modern import formats like OFX "
"and HBCI use a <quote>Transaction ID</quote> to identify transactions. When "
"you delete the imported transaction, the transaction ID goes with it, so the "
"importer has no way to know this transaction was already imported."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko saznate da unesena transakcija nije automatski povezana sa "
"postojećom transakcijom kada je trebala biti povezana, moguće ih je ručno "
"povezati. Imajte na umu da postoji razlika između ručnog povezivanja dvije "
"transakcije i jednostavnog brisanja jedne od njih, iako izgleda da je ishod "
"isti. Specifično sa OFX ili HBCI, važno je da ne obrišete unesene "
"transakcije zato što ćete primijetiti da sljedeći putkada budete unosili "
"svoje transakcije, obrisane transakcije će se ponovo pojaviti. Ovo je zato "
"što moderni formati unosa kao što je OFX i HBCI koriste <quote>Transaction "
"ID</quote> da identificiraju transakcije. Kada obrišete unesenu transakciju, "
"transakcijski ID nestane sa njom, pa importer ne zna da je transakcija već "
"unesena."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:522
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The solution is to tell &kappname; that the transactions are the same, "
#| "using the manual matching interface. This allows you to match an imported "
#| "transaction with a hand-entered (non-imported) transaction. To do so, "
#| "select one of the transactions to be matched by clicking on it, then "
#| "select the other by left clicking on it while pressing the &Ctrl; key, "
#| "and then select <guimenuitem>Match</guimenuitem> from the context menu. "
#| "This changes the background color to a pale green. This will match and "
#| "combine the two transactions together. The values of both transactions "
#| "must be the same for the match to work, except that the dates may differ "
#| "by the window specified in the settings, as described above. If you are "
#| "happy with the result, right click the matched transaction, then select "
#| "<guibutton>Accept</guibutton>."
msgid ""
"The solution is to tell &kmymoney; that the transactions are the same, using "
"the manual matching interface. This allows you to match an imported "
"transaction with a hand-entered (non-imported) transaction. To do so, select "
"one of the transactions to be matched by clicking on it, then select the "
"other by left clicking on it while pressing the &Ctrl; key, and then select "
"<guimenuitem>Match</guimenuitem> from the context menu. This changes the "
"background color to a pale green. This will match and combine the two "
"transactions together. The values of both transactions must be the same for "
"the match to work, except that the dates may differ by the window specified "
"in the settings, as described above. If you are happy with the result, right "
"click the matched transaction, then select <guibutton>Accept</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Rješenje je da kažete &kappname; da su transakcije iste, upotrebom "
"interfejsa ručnog povezivanja. ovo vam omogućava da povežete unesenu "
"transakciju sa ručno upisanom transakcijom. Da biste uradili to, odaberite "
"jednu od transakciju koju ćete povezati klikom na nju, zatim odabirom druge "
"lijevim klikom dok držite &Ctrl; tipku, te potom odaberite "
"<guimenuitem>Match</guimenuitem> iz konteksnog menija. Ovo mijenja pozadinu "
"u blijedu zelenu boju. Ovo će povezati i iskombinovati ove dvije "
"transakcije. Iznosi obje transakcije moraju biti isti da bi povezivanje "
"radilo, osim datuma koji mogu biti drugačiji u prozoru specificiranom u "
"postavkama, kao što je opisano iznad. Ukoliko ste zadovoljni rezultatom, "
"desni klik na povezanu transakciju i odaberite <guibutton>Accept</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:536
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "During import of online statements - either directly or by importing a "
#| "downloaded file - &kappname; performs matching as best as it can based on "
#| "the name of the payee and the amount of the transaction. In case of an "
#| "invalid match, a matched transaction can be unmatched."
msgid ""
"During import of online statements - either directly or by importing a "
"downloaded file - &kmymoney; performs matching as best as it can based on "
"the name of the payee and the amount of the transaction. In case of an "
"invalid match, a matched transaction can be unmatched."
msgstr ""
"Tokom unosa online izjava - ili direktno ili unosom downloadovane datoteke - "
"&kappname; izvršava povezivanje najbolje što može bazirano na imenu payee-a "
"i iznosa transakcije. U slučaju neispravnog povezivanja, povezane "
"transakcije se mogu odspojiti."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:544
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The matching interface will not allow you to match two transactions which "
"have both been imported. Likewise, it won't allow matching between two "
"transactions which have both been entered by hand."
msgstr ""
"Interfejs povezivanja vam neće dopustiti da povežete dvije transakcije "
"ukoliko su obje unesene. Analogno, neće dopustiti povezivanje između dvije "
"transakcije ukoliko su obje unesene ručno."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:553
#, no-c-format
msgid "Understanding the Cleared State"
msgstr "Razumijevanje očišćenog stanja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:555
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A transaction can have one of three states: non-reconciled, cleared (C), and "
"reconciled (R). When you enter a transaction, it has state non-reconciled. "
"Once the bank posts the transaction, the user can clear it and thus "
"transform it to state (C). When you receive a statement from the bank, all "
"cleared transactions should be on the statement."
msgstr ""
"Transakcija može biti u jednom od tri stanja: neizmiren, očišćen (C) i "
"izmiren (R). Kada unesete transakciju, nalazi se u neizmirenom stanju. Nakon "
"što banka postavi transakciju, korisnik je može očistiti i time je "
"transformisati u stanje (C). Kada primite izjavu od banke, sve očišćene "
"transakcije bi trebale biti na izjavi."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-ledgers.docbook:565
#, no-c-format
msgid "Understanding the cleared state"
msgstr "Razumijevanje očišćenog stanja"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid "cleared state"
msgstr "očišćeno stanje"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:577
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you <link linkend=\"details.reconcile\">reconcile your account</link>, "
"you actually mark the statements as cleared and check that the difference "
"between the beginning balance and the cleared transactions equals the ending "
"balance of the statement. When this is the case, you can 'finish "
"reconciling' which actually changes the state of all cleared transactions "
"(C) to reconciled (R)."
msgstr ""
"Kada <link linkend=\"details.reconcile\">izmirite svoj račun</link>, vi "
"ustvari označavate izjave kao očišćene i provjeravate da li razlika između "
"početnog bilansa i očišćenih transakcija odgovara konačnom bilansu izjave. "
"Kada je tako, možete 'završiti izmirivanje' što ustvari promijeni stanje "
"svih očišćenih transakcija (C) u izmirene (R)."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:585
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you try to edit a transaction with at least one split marked as "
"reconciled (R), you will be warned."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko pokušate editovati transakciju sa barem jednom podjelom označenom sa "
"izmirena (R), bićete upozoreni."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:590
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A fourth state is defined (frozen (F)) but there's currently no way to set "
"it. It is reserved for future use. Nevertheless, if a transaction has at "
"least one split in state frozen it cannot be edited anymore."
msgstr ""
"Četvrto stanje je definisano (zaleđena(F)) ali trenutno ne postoji način da "
"se postavi. Čuva se za buduću upotrebu. Ipak, ukoliko transakcija ima barem "
"jednu podjelu zaleđenu, ne može više biti editovana."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:599
#, no-c-format
msgid "Changing Transaction Settings"
msgstr "Promjena postavki transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:601
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "There are several settings options that change the appearance and "
#| "behavior of the ledger view in terms of transactions. These settings are "
#| "found by selecting <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure "
#| "&kappname;</guimenuitem> from the menu bar, and selecting the "
#| "<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
#| "\"ledgers_view.png\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject>Register</"
#| "guiicon> icon from the list on the left."
msgid ""
"There are several settings options that change the appearance and behavior "
"of the ledger view in terms of transactions. These settings are found by "
"selecting <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kmymoney;</"
"guimenuitem> from the menu bar, and selecting the "
"<guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"ledgers_view."
"png\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject>Register</guiicon> icon from the "
"list on the left."
msgstr ""
"Postoji više postavki koje mijenjaju izgled i ponašanje glavnog pregleda što "
"se tiče transakcija. Ove postavke se mogu pronaći <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;</guimenuitem>  u meni baru, te "
"odabirom <guiicon><inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref="
"\"ledgers_view.png\"/> </imageobject></inlinemediaobject>Register</guiicon> "
"ikone u listi lijevo."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:611
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Most of the settings are self explanatory. For clarity, several of the "
"settings are explained below."
msgstr ""
"Većina postavki je opisana po svom imenu. Radi jasnoće, nekoliko postavki je "
"opisano ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:618
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Show transaction form (under the Display tab) - toggle to hide the "
"transaction input area at the bottom of this screen. Transactions can still "
"be entered directly into an empty line at the end of the transaction list, "
"through an automatic compact entry area."
msgstr ""
"Prikaži formu transakcije(pod Display tabom) - koristi se za sakrivanje "
"prostora za unos transakcije na dnu ekrana. Transakcije se idalje mogu "
"unijeti direktno u praznu liniju na kraju liste transakcija, kroz automatski "
"kompaktni prostor za unos."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:627
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"These images show what direct transaction entry looks like compared to the "
"transaction form."
msgstr ""
"Ove slike pokazuju kako direktni unos transakcije izgleda u poređenju sa "
"formom transakcije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The transaction input form</para>"
msgstr "<para>Forma za unos transakcije</para>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-ledgers.docbook:636
#, no-c-format
msgid "The transaction form"
msgstr "Forma transakcije"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:642
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transaction form"
msgstr "Forma transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:648
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Transactions entered directly</para>"
msgstr "<para>Direktno unesena transakcija</para>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-ledgers.docbook:652
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>Transactions entered directly</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>Direktno unesena transakcija</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:658
#, no-c-format
msgid "Direct input"
msgstr "Direktni unos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:666
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Keep changes when selecting a different transaction/split - by selecting the "
"next line in the transaction list or split editor, the changes are kept, "
"instead of the default behavior where you have to push the green check mark "
"to save changes."
msgstr ""
"Zadržite promjene prilikom odabira različitih transakcija/podjela - "
"slektiranjem sljedeće linije u listi transakcije ili editoru podjela, "
"promjene će biti sačuvane, umjesto unaprijed definisanog ponašanja gdje "
"morate pritisnuti zelenu oznaku da biste sačuvali promjene."

#. Tag: title
#: details-ledgers.docbook:678
#, no-c-format
msgid "Other Functionality"
msgstr "Ostale funkcionalnosti"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:680
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additional options are available from the <guimenu>Transaction Options</"
"guimenu> menu, accessed by right-clicking any transaction in the list."
msgstr ""
"Dodatne opcije su omogućene u<guimenu>Transaction Options</guimenu> meniju, "
"kojem se pristupa desnim klikom na bilo koju transakciju u listi."

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: details-ledgers.docbook:688
#, no-c-format
msgid "The transaction options sub-menu"
msgstr "Opcije podmenija transakcija"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-ledgers.docbook:694
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transaction options"
msgstr "Opcije transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:700
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Options include jumping to the Payee's page, creating a schedule, and "
"changing the reconciled or cleared indication."
msgstr ""
"Opcije uključuju prelazak na Primaočevu stranicu, kreiranje rasporeda i "
"mijenjanje izmirene i očišćene indikacije."

#. Tag: para
#: details-ledgers.docbook:705
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit the account information from the ledger view, select "
"<guimenu>Account</guimenu> from the menu bar. From this menu, you can change "
"the account details, or bring up the Reconcile menu, which allows you to "
"match transactions against an official bank statement or credit card notice."
msgstr ""
"Da biste editovali informaciju u glavnom pregledu, odaberite "
"<guimenu>Account</guimenu> iz meni bara. Iz ovog menija možete promijeniti "
"detalje o računu ili pozvati Izmirenje meni, koji vam omogućava da povežete "
"transakcije sa oficijalnom izjavom banke ili najavom kreditne kartice."
